&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black&quot;&gt;Dr. James Otavka, Medical Director of Site 226, is hereby promoted to Level 4 security clearance and named Interim Site Director of Site 226.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
